# Server Maintenance

Dear Doctor

We will conduct server maintenance on UTC 2026/1/29 08:00. The maintenance is expected to take 1.5 hours.

Main updates include:
1. Watchtower feature fix: resolved the issue of deploying heroes of non-corresponding faction;
2. Cheese Trap Event optimization: two different options for starting time;
3. Improved matching rules for various events;
4. Enhanced city battle experience;
5. Added rechargeable shield;
6. Fixed several bugs.

You will be unable to log in during the maintenance. Thank you for your support and cooperation. Enjoy the game!

Last Asylum Team
@everyone
